      "slug": "minimal",
      "name": "Minimal ID Card",
      "description": "Clean and understated design with a student badge label and light borders.",
      "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n  @page { size: 86mm 54mm; margin: 0; }\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; }\n  .card {\n    width: 86mm;\n    height: 54mm;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: 3mm 4mm;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    page-break-after: always;\n  }\n  .top-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 2mm;\n    border-bottom: 0.5px solid #ccc;\n    padding-bottom: 2mm;\n    margin-bottom: 2mm;\n  }\n  .top-row .logo {\n    width: 8mm;\n    height: 8mm;\n    object-fit: contain;\n  }\n  .top-row .school-text {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .top-row .school-name {\n    font-size: 8pt;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .top-row .school-loc {\n    font-size: 5.5pt;\n    color: #777;\n  }\n  .top-row .badge {\n    font-size: 6pt;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #555;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    padding: 1mm 2mm;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .content {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 3mm;\n  }\n  .photo {\n    width: 16mm;\n    height: 20mm;\n    border: 0.5px solid #ccc;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n  }\n  .photo-placeholder {\n    width: 16mm;\n    height: 20mm;\n    border: 0.5px solid #ccc;\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #bbb;\n    font-size: 5pt;\n  }\n  .fields {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .student-name {\n    font-size: 10pt;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5mm;\n  }\n  .field {\n    display: flex;\n    font-size: 7pt;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .field .label {\n    color: #888;\n    width: 15mm;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .field .value {\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .footer-row {\n    margin-top: auto;\n    padding-top: 1.5mm;\n    border-top: 0.5px solid #ccc;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 5.5pt;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"top-row\">\n    {{#if school.logoUrl}}\n    <img class=\"logo\" src=\"{{school.logoUrl}}\" alt=\"\">\n    {{/if}}\n    <div class=\"school-text\">\n      <div class=\"school-name\">{{school.name}}</div>\n      <div class=\"school-loc\">{{school.location}}</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"badge\">Student</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    {{#if student.photoUrl}}\n    <img class=\"photo\" src=\"{{student.photoUrl}}\" alt=\"\">\n    {{else}}\n    <div class=\"photo-placeholder\">Photo</div>\n    {{/if}}\n\n    <div class=\"fields\">\n      <div class=\"student-name\">{{student.name}}</div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"label\">Adm No</span><span class=\"value\">{{student.admissionNo}}</span></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"label\">Class</span><span class=\"value\">{{student.className}} – {{student.sectionName}}</span></div>\n      {{#if student.rollNo}}\n      <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"label\">Roll No</span><span class=\"value\">{{student.rollNo}}</span></div>\n      {{/if}}\n      <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"label\">DOB</span><span class=\"value\">{{student.dob}}</span></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"label\">Father</span><span class=\"value\">{{student.fatherName}}</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-row\">\n    <span>{{session.startYear}}–{{session.endYear}}</span>\n    {{#if school.registrationNo}}<span>Reg: {{school.registrationNo}}</span>{{/if}}\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
